{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13009","headline":"江宁詶郑县刘少府兄赠别作 · 独孤及","name":"江宁詶郑县刘少府兄赠别作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往年脱缝掖，接武仕关西。\n结绶腰章并，趋堦手板齐。\n仙山不用买，朋酒日相携。\n抵掌夸潭壑，忘情向组珪。\n事迁时既往，年长迹逾暌。\n何爲青云器，犹嗟浊水泥。\n役牵方远别，道在或先迷。\n莫见良田晚，遭时亦杖藜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}